<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-eugracilis-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.5 µm in Drosophila eugracilis (Pass 2 sweep and controls) — MorphoEval overall 86.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the focal 1.485 µm Schnakenberg lattice and adds a six-point gamma sweep (0.50, 0.75, 1, 1.25, 1.584, 2). Analytic versus FFT wavelength Pearson r = 0.992, RMSE = 0.701 µm (the FFT ring sits systematically long of k_c; values are not equal). Equal diffusion D_u = D_v is not Turing and decays to activator std 2.5e-4 against Turing std 1.23. Blurred-arm foreground fraction is 0.177 versus raw Otsu 0.141. Plate-versus-render KS is 0.343. CV similarity of the 12-frame 720x540 GIF to the gallery plate is 88.6. Age remains 0 Ma; erecta lambda is 2.100 µm and ficusphila is 1.180 µm. Overall 86.1/100 (faithfulness 84.6, reproducibility 89.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 76, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 88, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_eugracilis_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-eugracilis-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/png, 476053 B, 1792×1148 px, artifact_sha256 6d16c18dee30d5d187f765e4dcb77304ca63822df7e92fc4c0a1e3ea7710ffbc (sha256 6d16c18dee30d5d187f765e4dcb77304ca63822df7e92fc4c0a1e3ea7710ffbc), spec_fingerprint 4cd159ca0e54b6b9882667ea66ee1c36e85c25ecfd3d9cd25e35efca3e35cc7f. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 4cd159ca0e54b6b9882667ea66ee1c36e85c25ecfd3d9cd25e35efca3e35cc7f; artifact_sha256: 6d16c18dee30d5d187f765e4dcb77304ca63822df7e92fc4c0a1e3ea7710ffbc; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_eugracilis_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_eugracilis_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=aeae6e2ee094bbd3..., datasets/drosophila_eugracilis_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_eugracilis_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=f3705e558598c7f5..., datasets/drosophila_eugracilis_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=963fd37391fe7bc7...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-drosophila-eugracilis-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation and a critical wavenumber. | Schnakenberg 1979 two-species kinetics. | Murray 1981 scale parameter controlling pattern spacing. | Tanaka, Barmina and Kopp 2009: sex-comb mechanisms differ among Drosophila species, including rotation versus longitudinal birth of the row. | Yassin et al. 2016: female-limited colour dimorphism has recurred in Drosophila. | Ready, Hanson and Benzer 1976: periodic retinal lattice.; reconstructed_in_script: Length unit chosen so gamma=1 yields 1.485e-6 m. | gamma_erecta=0.5 and lambda_ficusphila=1.180 µm as this scale's chronoseries contrast. | Nonlinear FFT wavelength series, equal-diffusion ablation, blurred Otsu mask, KS luminance.; transfer_boundary: Gallery JPEG is a canonical spiral plate (100 µm bar), not a micrograph of D. eugracilis. Commons had no species bitmap on 2026-10-27. | Spot-lattice reciprocal wavenumber is not identical to the linear k_c; RMSE 0.701 µm is that bias.; does_not_claim: A published 1.485 µm measurement on D. eugracilis ocelli or sex-comb teeth. | Stratigraphic ancestry of erecta to eugracilis. Both are extant; 13/41 is the catalog chronoseries index. | Sibling primordium parameters (101 µm, alpha 1.555) or DOI 10.1016/j.ydbio.2009.04.012. | A nanopublication signature. No ~/.nanopub/profile.yml was present.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R5', 'item': 'An independent second assessor has not scored this audit. Left open; it is not a numeric gate failure.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R6', 'item': 'FFT wavelengths sit about 0.70 µm long of analytic k_c (hexagonal ring versus linear mode). A spot-spacing correction could be reported beside the raw ring; the correlation is already 0.992 and was not forced through the identity line.'}" ;
    pk:hasScore 8.61e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-eugracilis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.5 µm in Drosophila eugracilis (Pass 2 sweep and controls) — Parameter expressivity: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Raising gamma from 0.50 (erecta, 2.100 µm) through 1 (eugracilis, 1.485 µm) to the ficusphila value shortens lambda_c monotonically, and the six-point nonlinear FFT series follows that order (r=0.992). Setting D_v = D_u makes the Turing discriminant fail and the activator std falls from 1.23 to 2.5e-4." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-eugracilis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-eugracilis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-eugracilis-turing-wavelength-s0-repro-package> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.5 µm in Drosophila eugracilis (Pass 2 sweep and controls) — Reproducibility package: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "--self-test passed: dispersion identity, ablation std < 0.05, patterned std > 0.4, and Pearson r > 0.98 on a four-point sweep with measured lambda not equal to analytic lambda. Seed 3184 and SHA-256 locks are checked at startup. GIF gate requires at least 10 frames and 480 px." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/repro-package" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-eugracilis-turing-wavelength-s0-repro-package-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-eugracilis-turing-wavelength-s0-repro-package-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-eugracilis-turing-wavelength-s0-source-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.5 µm in Drosophila eugracilis (Pass 2 sweep and controls) — Source and data traceability: 92/100" ;
