    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-eugracilis-turing-wavelength-s0.py, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/docs/media/drosophila_eugracilis_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif; output: docs/media/drosophila_eugracilis_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png; organism: Drosophila eugracilis; environment: n/a; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation and a critical wavenumber. | Schnakenberg 1979 two-species kinetics. | Murray 1981 scale parameter controlling pattern spacing. | Tanaka, Barmina and Kopp 2009: sex-comb mechanisms differ among Drosophila species, including rotation versus longitudinal birth of the row. | Yassin et al. 2016: female-limited colour dimorphism has recurred in Drosophila. | Ready, Hanson and Benzer 1976: periodic retinal lattice.; reconstructed_in_script: Length unit chosen so gamma=1 yields 1.485e-6 m. | gamma_erecta=0.5 and lambda_ficusphila=1.180 µm as this scale's chronoseries contrast. | Nonlinear FFT wavelength series, equal-diffusion ablation, blurred Otsu mask, KS luminance.; transfer_boundary: Gallery JPEG is a canonical spiral plate (100 µm bar), not a micrograph of D. eugracilis. Commons had no species bitmap on 2026-10-27. | Spot-lattice reciprocal wavenumber is not identical to the linear k_c; RMSE 0.701 µm is that bias.; does_not_claim: A published 1.485 µm measurement on D. eugracilis ocelli or sex-comb teeth. | Stratigraphic ancestry of erecta to eugracilis. Both are extant; 13/41 is the catalog chronoseries index. | Sibling primordium parameters (101 µm, alpha 1.555) or DOI 10.1016/j.ydbio.2009.04.012. | A nanopublication signature. No ~/.nanopub/profile.yml was present.]; phenomenon_size: 1.9 µm (1.919e-06 m, log10=-5.717 m, tier=3_subcellular_um); species_scale_ladder (10 runs from 1.9 µm to 4.3 mm): 1.9 µm:drosophila-affinis-bioelectric-polarity, 6.0 µm:drosophila-affinis-vertex-packing, 96 µm:drosophila-affinis-turing-wavelength, 192 µm:drosophila-affinis-clock-wavefront, 432 µm:drosophila-affinis-morphogen-condensation, 528 µm:drosophila-affinis-elastic-buckling, 600 µm:drosophila-affinis-flux-canalization, 840 µm:drosophila-affinis-branching-tree" ;
